- [A Guide for Enterprise Applicant Tracking Systems](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/nurture/a-guide-for-enterprise-applicant-tracking-systems/) - What qualifies as an enterprise company? In short, an enterprise is a large business or company with multiple divisions, levels, or groups. They have hundreds to thousands of employees behind the scenes. Enterprises will also have an annual recruiting budget, and they’re willing to pay for large purchases and investments up front instead of paying monthly.
