- [A Leader in the Gartner MQ for TAS](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/nurture/a-leader-in-the-2025-gartner-magic-quadrant-for-talent-acquisition-suites/) - The hiring landscape is changing. Legacy ATS platforms are no longer enough—AI-driven hiring is the future. In the 2025 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Talent Acquisition Suites, SmartRecruiters was recognized as a Leader for its ability to execute and completeness of vision.
- [A Leader in the 2025 IDC MarketScape™ for Worldwide Talent Acquisition](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/nurture/leader-2025-idc-marketscape/) - Today’s hiring demands more from recruiting technology. It’s time to move beyond legacy ATS systems with AI-driven innovation. In the IDC MarketScape for Worldwide Talent Acquisition 2025, SmartRecruiters was once again named a Leader.

