- [Pluralsight](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/success/customer/pluralsight/) - Pluralsight, one of the fastest-growing e-learning companies, planned to increase its employee base by 500% over 4 years. The hard part was they only had one recruiter, and tried two different applicant tracking systems (ATSs), but neither had worked out.
