- [Sana Commerce](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/success/customer/sana-commerce/) - Challenges As a high-growth eCommerce technology provider competing on the global stage, Sana Commerce felt its employer brand needed a dramatic transformation to attract top talent. The recruiting team struggled to provide candidates and employees with a consistent, engaging experience, and could not showcase the company’s progressive brand and values without a modernized careers page.
- [Equinox](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/success/customer/equinox/) - Hiring success is of critical importance for this human-centric business. The employees and their experience are the very product Equinox aims to sell and to achieve this they need to be able to find and hire the best people out there.

