## Glossary Terms

- [What is agentic CRM for your business?](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/what-is-agentic-crm/) - Learn how agentic CRM uses AI agents to discover, engage, and activate talent automatically, saving time and enhancing recruitment results.
- [Applicant Tracking Systems: What are they and how do they work?](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/applicant-tracking-system/) - Learn why a sophisticated ATS is essential for global organizations, offering automation, analytics, compliance, and a great user experience.
- [Candidate Relationship Management: Essential Guide to CRM for HR](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/candidate-relationship-management-crm/) - The CRM (candidate relationship management) is the process used by hiring professionals to manage the early phases of the recruitment process with job candidates.
- [Effective Interview Evaluation Forms For Better Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/interview-evaluation-form/) - Improve your interview process using structured evaluation forms that minimize bias, ensure consistency, and leverage new technologies for better candidate insights.
- [The New Hiring Process: Part Human, Part Automation](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/hiring-process-steps/) - Learn how AI technology is reshaping many steps of the hiring process, including finding, engaging, evaluating, assessing, and selecting ideal candidates.
- [Talent Acquisition Simplified: A Beginner's Guide to Future-Ready Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/talent-acquisition/) - Learn the essentials of talent acquisition and see how AI-driven tools are transforming how organizations find and retain top talent.
- [Recruitment Definition, Process and Types of Recruiting](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/recruitment/) - Learn about recruitment's vital role in human resource management. Explore innovative process methods to attract and hire the best candidates efficiently.
- [Essential Guide: Crafting Clear Offer Letters](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/job-offer-letter-template/) - Customizable examples for different professional industries, easy-to-edit samples that will help you make an offer letter to top talent for your job offerings.
- [Understanding One Click Apply: Quick Job Applications Explained](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/1-click-apply/) - One click apply offers convenience but may reduce your chances of standing out. Find out what job seekers and employers need to know.
- [Effective Interview Rating Sheets That Simplify Recruitment](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/interview-rating-sheet/) - Discover how structured interview rating sheets can enhance objectivity, reduce mis-hires, and help your business hire the best candidates.
- [Mastering Interview Scorecards: The Key to Fair and Effective Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/interview-scorecard/) - Understand key features of interview scorecards and how emerging technologies are revolutionizing candidate evaluation and hiring efficiency.
- [Recruiting Coordinator Roles Evolve: Key Skills for 2026](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/recruiting-coordinator/) - Explore the changing responsibilities of a recruiting coordinator, from manual tasks to strategic analytics, shaping the future of hiring.
- [The New Face of Job Boards: Features, Benefits, and Trends](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/job-board/) - Discover how modern job boards evolve beyond listings into dynamic talent marketplaces using AI, integrations, and enhanced candidate and employer services.
- [How Easy Apply Streamlines Your Job Search: What You Need to Know](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/easy-apply-job-applications/) - Explore the concept of easy apply, its advantages for job seekers, and its impact on recruitment, making applying faster but increasing application volume.
- [Job Posting 101: Strategies to Engage and Hire the Right Candidates](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/job-posting/) - Find out how modern job advertising techniques, including AI and targeted platforms, can help you reach the right applicants with ease.
- [Beginner's Guide to Writing a Job Description Template](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/job-description-template/) - Learn how to craft effective job descriptions with our professional guide, focusing on clarity, bias reduction, and attracting the right candidates using a comprehensive job description template.
- [HRIS Job Description Explained: Roles, Responsibilities, and Skills for Beginners](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/hris-job-description/) - Learn what an HRIS job description entails today, including AI integration, data analysis, and security challenges in HR, perfect for newcomers.
- [What Is an HR Business Partner? Key Responsibilities Explained](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/hr-business-partner-job-description/) - An HR Business Partner aligns HR strategy with business goals, advising leaders on talent, performance, and workforce planning to drive company success.
- [Skills Assessment Tests: A Beginner's Guide to Better Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/skills-test/) - To gauge the skills of job candidates, organizations use skills assessment tests, measuring personality, problem-solving, aptitude, or cognitive ability
- [Guide to HR Onboarding Specialist Responsibilities & Requirements](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/hr-onboarding-specialist-job-description/) - Discover what an HR onboarding specialist does and how they create smooth, welcoming onboarding experiences for new employees.
- [The Phone Screen Interview: A Beginner's Guide to Successful Phone Interviews](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/screening-questions/) - Discover essential screening questions for your initial phone interview to identify the right candidate quickly and effectively.
- [What is Resume Parsing and Why You Should be Using it](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/resume-parsing/) - Learn how advanced resume parsing automates candidate screening, saves time, and helps recruiters find the best talent faster.
- [Talent Pool Basics: Build and Use Candidate Databases](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/talent-pool/) - A talent pool is a database of potential job candidates. They are usually qualified and often have previously expressed interest in joining your organization.
- [Understanding Group Interviews:  What You Need to Know](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/group-interview/) - Learn what a group interview involves, its pros and cons, and tips on how to excel whether you're a candidate or interviewer.
- [Understanding Reference Checks: A Beginner's Guide to Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/reference-check/) - Discover the basics of reference checks and how they help verify a job candidate’s background to make informed hiring decisions.
- [Recruiter Basics: Who They Are & How They Assist Job Seekers](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/recruiter/) - A recruiter finds qualified candidates for a job opening and works to meet the demands of both the employer and the employee throughout the hiring process.
- [Understanding the Role of a Hiring Manager for Beginners](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/glossary/hiring-manager/) - Learn the key responsibilities of a hiring manager and how they select the best candidates, even if you're new to job hunting.

