- [From Bias to Brilliance – How Inclusion Transforms Talent Acquisition](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/from-bias-to-brilliance-how-inclusion-transforms-talent-acquisition/) - Diversity is a driving force behind innovation, productivity, and sustainable growth in our interconnected world. Diverse companies earn 2.5x higher cash flow per employee and diverse teams make better decisions 87% of the time (source: McKinsey D&I Global Market Report).
- [Tech Evolution for Recruitment Leaders: Dos and Don’ts](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/tech-evolution-for-recruitment-leaders-dos-and-donts/) - Staying up to speed on new technologies within the recruiting space is essential for talent acquisition leaders. However, the allure of shiny new tech can sometimes lead to distractions, overspending, and the introduction of disconnected one-off solutions that hinder efficiency. Watch this on-demand webinar as we cover the “dos and don’ts” of TA technology adoption
- [Removing the Bottlenecks from High Volume Hiring – APAC](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/removing-the-bottlenecks-from-high-volume-hiring-apac/) - Are you struggling with the challenges of high volume hiring? Finding it difficult to streamline your recruitment processes and manage large-scale talent acquisition efficiently?
- [High-Touch Recruiting: How Personalization Can Find You The Perfect Hire](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/high-touch-recruiting-how-personalization-can-find-you-the-perfect-hire/) - Are you tired of the same old recruiting methods that yield mediocre results? It's time to embrace a more personal approach to finding your next star team member.
- [Maximising Hiring Team Collaboration in the Recruitment Process – APAC](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/maximising-hiring-team-collaboration-in-the-recruitment-process-apac/) - Are you tired of the chaos that comes with juggling multiple communication tools during the hiring process? How would simplified recruitment workflows and reduced time-to-hire impact your TA org? Our on-demand webinar will unveil how our TA tech (including a brand new integration) simplifies your recruitment workflow, without the hassle of switching between platforms.
- [From Zero to Hero: 3 Erfolgsstrategien für den Aufbau qualitativer Talent Pools](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/de/resources/webinars/from-zero-to-hero-3-erfolgsstrategien-fuer-den-aufbau-qualitativer-talent-pools/)
- [The Future of Recruiting: New Rules, New Tools, New Paradigms](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/the-future-of-recruiting-new-rules-new-tools-new-paradigms/) - The world of recruiting has fundamentally shifted. We have witnessed the perfect storm of rising exceptions, cultural reframing, economic uncertainty, and technological advancement. The result is a new set of rules, tools and paradigms for talent acquisition. In this 30 min talk, Allyn walks us through what has changed and is changing and the impact to how talent acquisition teams should be approaching candidate experience going forward. This is conversation that will connect the dots between the changes you are seeing in the world around you and how they impact your candidates, stakeholders and teams.
- [The Value of TA: How to show your Business Impact](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/the-value-of-ta-how-to-show-your-business-impact/) - Are you ready to change your talent acquisition game and become a strategic powerhouse within your organization? Tony de Graaf, SmartRecruiters' Global GTM Director Services shares in our recent webinar, the secrets to transforming your TA function and driving tangible business impact.
- [Why Talent Acquisition Should Be One of Your Key Business Initiatives](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/why-talent-acquisition-should-be-one-of-your-key-business-initiatives/) - The talent acquisition technology landscape has shifted significantly with new providers and categories entering the market, but AI is the common denominator. Companies are using, on average, 10 or more providers to support everything from recruitment marketing to onboarding. The interest and investment in AI show no signs of stopping, and today’s companies have more options and opportunities than ever before. But navigating this landscape and truly understanding AI’s impact has become increasingly complex even for the most sophisticated buyers. Companies are not always clear what solutions to consider and what drives results.
- [Job Advertising That Aligns To Business Needs](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/job-advertising-that-aligns-to-business-needs/) - Struggling with a difficult-to-measure job advertising experience? Feeling trapped inside the box of legacy software that won’t adapt to business needs? Check out our on-demand webinar to hear Krystina Hutnyan, Enterprise Solutions Consultant, and Emi Candan, Solution Architect.
- [Talent Acquisition in the Face of Uncertainty: Future-Proofing Your TA Function](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/talent-acquisition-in-the-face-of-uncertainty-future-proofing-your-ta-function/) - Join us for a free webinar, as our panel of experts explore how TA teams can future-proof recruiting functions by leveraging processes and technologies specifically selected for navigating uncertainty. These experts will share their experiences and offer advice on how to prepare for the future of TA.
- [Finding the Talent You Need to Grow Your Organization](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/finding-the-talent-you-need-to-grow-your-organization/) - Did you know that 39% of talent leaders agree that quality of hire is the most valuable metric to evaluate performance and rank it as their top priority? Discover the secret to attracting and hiring top-tier talent at our upcoming webinar, Finding the Talent You Need to Grow Your Organization. Say goodbye to recruitment challenges and hello to a streamlined process that delivers results.
- [Creating an Effective Recruitment Marketing Strategy](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/creating-an-effective-recruitment-marketing-strategy/) - Looking to expand beyond traditional sourcing and advertising methods? Check out our on-demand webinar, "Creating an Effective Recruitment Marketing Strategy"
- [Building a High-Converting Career Site](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/building-a-high-converting-career-site/) - Is your team investing in job boards only to see candidates not convert on your career site? It’s time to transform your career site and elevate your candidate experience.
- [TA Agility: Break Free From Your Clunky ATS Experience](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ta-agility-break-free-from-your-clunky-ats-experience/) - Is your ATS disjointed? Does it lack the flexibility your team needs? Does it provide recruiters, hiring managers and candidates with a negative experience?
- [GOING DIGITAL IN TALENT ACQUISITION: A Reflection on 2022 Digital Experience Delivery](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/going-digital-in-talent-acquisition-a-reflection-on-2022-digital-experience-delivery/)
- [How A Modern Talent Acquisition Suite Can Boost Your Hiring Success](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/how-a-modern-talent-acquisition-suite-can-boost-your-hiring-success/) - Is your legacy applicant tracking system holding you back? In today’s scalding job market, modern features such as built-in recruitment marketing, AI, and predictive analytics are must-haves in an effective talent strategy. This on-demand webinar will give you insight into the key features that are missing from legacy systems, and how SmartRecruiters has built a Modern Talent Acquisition Suite to innovate and evolve in an ever-changing talent landscape.
- [How to Create a Business Case for Recruitment CRM](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/how-to-create-a-business-case-for-recruitment-crm/) - A Candidate Relationship Management (CRM) system is a critical component of the modern talent acquisition technology stack. With CRM becoming the ubiquitous choice in talent acquisition tech, the challenge most companies face is understanding their main requirements, how to run an informed buying process and how to build a business case to prove the investment will be worth it.
- [Building the Business Case for TA Transformation](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/building-the-business-case-for-ta-transformation/) - With the wheels of talent acquisition slowing down globally, this crisis presents new challenges along with new opportunities for TA leaders. The time is now for them to not only demonstrate the value of Talent Acquisition but also to build a solid business case for a modernized TA function.
- [TA Today Webinar Series](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ta-today-webinar-series/) - For Talent Acquisition teams who were so desperately lacking in time in the past but have suddenly found it, the coming weeks will be the optimal time to invest in your industry - invest in your people, review processes, and evaluate technologies.
- [Hiring Success How to Build a Differentiated Talent Attraction Strategy](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/hiring-success-how-to-build-a-differentiated-talent-attraction-strategy/) - 77% of CEOs see failure to consistently hire great talent on-demand as the biggest threat to their business. In other words, in a job market driven by an expanding skills gap, dropping tenure, the rise of the gig economy, globalization and ever-increasing job complexity, the ability of businesses to hire the best talent for any role, on-demand and on budget becomes their biggest competitive advantage.
- [Q&A – Ask an Expert TA Transformation and Implementation](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/qa-ask-an-expert-ta-transformation-and-implementation/) - Join Nicole Hammond, Director of Hiring Success and Alison Bosch, Director of Professional Services at SmartRecruiters, for a live Q&A on digital transformation in Talent Acquisition.
- [Candidate Experience - What's Working, What's Not and What's Next](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/candidate-experience-whats-working-whats-not-and-whats-next/) - Candidate Experience is more important than ever, and one of the biggest differentiators for companies looking to attract, hire and retain the best talent. ConveyIQ, Glassdoor, and SmartRecruiters present you the webinar"Candidate Experience: What's Working, What's Not and What's Next", where our panel of talent acquisition leaders will share how they are addressing Candidate Experience at their companies.
- [Tipico’s 2 Year Transformed TA Function](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/tipicos-2-year-transformed-ta-function/) - In this session, you will learn how Tipico planned and executed their transformation process, using automation and artificial intelligence to build a hyper-growth recruitment engine. The results: 700 hires with an average time to hire of 39 days and a cost per hire of just 1,700€. And all that without losing sight of what’s really important: their candidates.
- [TA Transformation Online Conference](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ta-transformation-online-conference/) - In an era where talent is no longer a commodity, only the very best recruiting technology will enable companies to keep up with hiring needs. But digital transformation can’t happen overnight. The way to hiring success includes choosing the right partners, managing your stakeholders, orchestrating a flawless implementation and improving talent acquisition outcomes.
- [Building a Business Case for Hiring Success in Retail](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/building-a-business-case-for-hiring-success-in-retail/) - When your candidates are also your customers, recruitment takes on a whole new importance - this is why retail businesses face incredible challenges, trying to match their candidate experience with their consumer experience. So how can Talent Acquisition leaders ensure they leverage the very best technologies in order to support resourcing?
- [A Path to Hiring Success Sourcing, Recruiting, and the Org Structure that will support both](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/a-path-to-hiring-success-sourcing-recruiting-and-the-org-structure-that-will-support-both/) - Nothing is more important to your organization than the people you hire. But with competitors courting the best talent, demographic changes, and ever-evolving organizational demands, talent pipelines seem to be thinning, putting businesses at risk.
- [The High Tech, High Touch Future of Recruiting](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/high-tech-high-touch-recruiting/) - Attendees are in for a fascinating glimpse of how Lou embeds his Performance-based Hiring methodology by leveraging the power and flexibility of the SmartRecruiters Talent Acquisition Suite. The webinar will tie it all together – the past, present and future of “High Tech, High Touch” recruiting.
- [How HR Technology is Transforming the Candidate Experience. AI, CRM... and more.](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/how-hr-technology-is-transforming-the-candidate-experience/) - Technology is rapidly transforming the way we interact with our candidates: from having a chatbot answer first questions about a job, fully automated skill assessments to candidate relationship management programs that pick the right content at the right time to re-engage talent from your own talent pool through targeted email campaigns - nothing is impossible anymore. But how do recruiters leverage the full power of this new technology without losing touch with the human side of recruiting: the people they want to hire?
- [The New Rule Book of Talent Acquisition How to Select the Right Tech, the Right People, and Whether to Trust Your Gut](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/the-new-rule-book-of-talent-acquisition/) - The paradigm-shift in Talent Acquisition is almost complete, with TA departments globally adopting new tools and protocols to optimise their processes. And yet, it often feels as if the technology designed to enable us to hire better is doing the opposite, keeping us from simplifying, identifying the right people, and putting the “human” back in HR.
- [See How SmartRecruiters & LinkedIn Partner to Streamline Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/see-how-smartrecruiters-linkedin-partner-to-streamline-hiring/) - SmartRecruiters has solidified its preferred partnership with LinkedIn, the world's largest online professional network, through a new and enhanced technology integration that streamlines the recruiting workflow and candidate data quality.
- [5 Ways Artificial Intelligence will make Recruiting Smarter – and more Human](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/5-ways-artificial-intelligence-will-make-recruiting-smarter-and-more-human/)
- [Measuring & Maximizing Quality of Hire](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/measuring-maximizing-quality-of-hire/) - If you want to raise the talent bar at your company, you’ll need to be able to measure Quality of Hire (QoH) throughout the entire hiring cycle. But how do you predict, track and measure QoH before making the offer?
- [Better Talent Faster? It’s Possible!](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/better-talent-faster-its-possible/)
- [How Recruitment Marketing Leads To Hiring Success](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/how-recruitment-marketing-leads-to-hiring-success/) - Talent acquisition professionals are changing the way they attract talent. Often referred to as the “pre-applicant platform”, recruitment marketing includes capabilities that maintain the employer brand, foster candidate relationships and enhance messaging and communication efforts - all key aspects of a true next-generation, enterprise-ready ATS. While recruitment marketing can transform a talent acquisition function, the real value is found in a solution that integrates and supports the overall talent acquisition strategy.
- [How Hospitality & Retail Hiring Can Happen Anywhere](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/how-hospitality-retail-hiring-can-happen-anywhere/) - In today’s connected world, flexible hiring is a necessity. Add on the high volume nature of the Hospitality and Retail industries and the need to hire at any time and any place is crucial.
- [Hiring During a Crisis: How TA Leaders are Navigating COVID-19](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/hiring-during-a-crisis-how-ta-leaders-are-navigating-covid-19/) - Since early March, it seems impossible to go about "business as usual". As Talent Acquisition and HR leaders, the current crisis deeply affects the way in which you protect your employees and hire great people - and there seem to be no easy answers. This panel webinar sheds light on how your peers are dealing with this unforeseen, and largely unquantifiable, challenge.
- [Die DSGVO und ihre Auswirkungen aufs Recruiting 2: Datenverarbeitung](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/de/resources/webinars/die-dsgvo-und-ihre-auswirkungen-aufs-recruiting-2-datenverarbeitung/) - Valérie Bertrand, Head of Legal bei SmartRecruiters, und Michael Lazik, VP DACH, erläutern die Bedingungen der neuen EU-Datenschutz-Grundverordnung und deren Auswirkungen auf Ihre Recruiting-Prozesse.
- [AI for Superhuman Hiring™: Optimizing Candidate, Recruiter, and Hiring Manager Workflows](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ai-for-superhuman-hiring-optimizing-candidate-recruiter-and-hiring-manager-workflows/) - Explore the expanding role of AI in recruitment technology and its impact across candidate, recruiter, and hiring manager experiences. This webinar dives into practical use cases to demonstrate how AI can streamline hiring workflows to make the process simpler, faster, and more enjoyable.
- [Trick or Treat? How to Ensure Your Candidate Experience Isn’t Spooking Top Talent](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/trick-or-treat-how-to-ensure-your-candidate-experience-isnt-spooking-top-talent/) - Are you ready for a Halloween treat? Join us for a chillingly insightful on-demand webinar where we’ll uncover how to transform your candidate experience from scary to spectacular!
- [How People, Process, and Tech Can Bridge the Candidate Expectation Gap](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/how-people-process-and-tech-can-bridge-the-candidate-expectation-gap/) - Are you ready to tackle the ever-widening gap between candidate expectations and employer needs? Join SmartRecruiters, Visa, and Page Outsourcing for an insightful on-demand webinar where we explore the crucial elements needed to bridge this divide and set your organization up for success.
- [AI in Recruitment: How to Hire Faster and Smarter](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ai-in-recruitment-how-to-hire-faster-and-smarter/) - In today's competitive job market, finding the right talent quickly and efficiently is business-critical. In this on-demand webinar, we explore the transformative impact of AI on the hiring process. Discover how AI-powered technology can streamline candidate sourcing, enhance screening accuracy, and reduce time-to-hire, all while maintaining a high standard of candidate quality.
- [From Numbers to Narratives: Unlocking the Power of Recruitment Data](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/from-numbers-to-narratives-unlocking-the-power-of-recruitment-data/) - In the high-stakes world of talent acquisition, recruiters are under pressure to accelerate the hiring process without compromising on the quality of hires. The secret lies in harnessing the power of data – recruiters who utilize data can streamline their efforts, cut costs, and improve hiring outcomes.
- [Removing the Bottlenecks from High Volume Hiring](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/removing-the-bottlenecks-from-high-volume-hiring/) - Are you struggling with the challenges of high volume hiring? Finding it difficult to streamline your recruitment processes and manage large-scale talent acquisition efficiently? Look no further! Watch our exclusive on-demand webinar to discover powerful solutions that can make high volume hiring a breeze.
- [Delivering Excellence: How to Audit Then Improve Candidate Experience](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/delivering-excellence-how-to-audit-then-improve-candidate-experience/) - Measuring candidate experience can be challenging, but it is essential for companies to thoroughly understand their recruitment processes and be able to identify areas for improvement. Join Mary Faulkner and Allyn Bailey for a free webinar as they delve into an area that is often open to subjective interpretation. This session will provide clear examples of how to assess your company’s candidate experience, then offer insight on what can be done to innovate and evolve.
- [The Secrets to TA Technology Change Management](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/the-secrets-to-ta-technology-change-management/) - Change has been more than constant over the last few years, and no one has been impacted harder than TA. Adopting new technology in the midst of all of that change can be overwhelming. How can your team use your technology efficiently as new features are released, new hires are on boarded, and processes are inconsistent?
- [AI for Superhuman Hiring: Meet Winston – SmartRecruiters’ AI Companion](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ai-for-superhuman-hiring-meet-winston-smartrecruiters-ai-companion/) - This webinar introduces you to Winston, the game-changer AI sidekick that is revolutionising hiring workflows to make the process simpler, faster, and more enjoyable.
- [Automate, Anticipate, Accelerate: Transform Your Team’s Hiring Workflow](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/automate-anticipate-accelerate-transform-your-teams-hiring-workflow/)
- [Recrutement par l'IA : une réponse concrète pour simplifier durablement le quotidien des recruteurs](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/fr/resources/webinars/recrutement-par-lia-une-reponse-concrete-pour-simplifier-durablement-le-quotidien-des-recruteurs/)
- [Are You Ready for a Seismic Shift in AI-Powered Recruitment Technology? Meet Winston](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/are-you-ready-for-a-seismic-shift-in-ai-powered-recruitment-technology-meet-winston/) - Meet Winston, the AI companion redefining what’s possible in talent acquisition. In this dynamic webinar, we’ll showcase how Winston revolutionizes hiring with cutting-edge features that anticipate, automate and add a touch of joy to the hiring process.
- [Ready to Meet Winston?](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/ready-to-meet-winston/) - Ready to Meet Winston?: Your AI side-kick adding a bit of joy into the hiring process. Join our on-demand recap of how Winston will take on some of those tedious jobs you really don't love to hate.
- [Screen Smarter, Not Harder: Save Hours and Surface the Right Candidates Instantly](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/webinars/screen-smarter-not-harder-save-hours-and-surface-the-right-candidates-instantly/)
