## eBooks

- [SmartRecruiters pour les environnements SAP SuccessFactors](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/fr/resources/ebooks/smartrecruiters-pour-les-environnements-sap-successfactors/) - Choisir la bonne plateforme de recrutement est essentiel pour les entreprises qui utilisent SAP SuccessFactors. Les responsables RH et HRIT ont besoin d’une solution capable de prendre en charge des workflows de recrutement modernes, d’automatiser les tâches à faible valeur et de répondre aux exigences des grandes organisations.
- [SmartRecruiters for SAP SuccessFactors Environments](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/smartrecruiters-for-sap-successfactors-environments/) - Choosing the right recruiting platform is critical for organizations running SAP SuccessFactors. HR and HRIT leaders need solutions that support modern recruiting workflows, automation, and enterprise scalability.
- [Einblicke in die KI-Architektur von SmartRecruiters](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/de/resources/ebooks/einblicke-in-die-ki-architektur-von-smartrecruiters/)
- [SmartRecruiters in SAP- SuccessFactors-Umgebungen](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/de/resources/ebooks/smartrecruiters-in-sap-successfactors-umgebungen/) - Die Wahl der richtigen Recruiting-Plattform ist entscheidend für Unternehmen, die SAP SuccessFactors einsetzen. HR- und HRIT-Verantwortliche brauchen Lösungen, die moderne Recruiting-Workflows, Automatisierung und Skalierbarkeit auf Enterprise-Niveau unterstützen.
- [Erfolgreich Talente gewinnen in Zeiten von KI, Automatisierung und datenbasierten Entscheidungen](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/de/resources/ebooks/erfolgreich-talente-gewinnen-in-zeiten-von-ki-automatisierung-und-datenbasierten-entscheidungen/)
- [Inside the AI Architecture of SmartRecruiters](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/inside-the-ai-architecture-of-smartrecruiters/) - Artificial intelligence is transforming how companies hire. With AI embedded across the SmartRecruiters platform, talent acquisition teams can automate repetitive tasks, improve candidate engagement, and make faster hiring decisions.
- [The Redesign of Hiring: How Orchestration, Agentic Al, and Workforce Intelligence Will Reshape Work in 2026](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/the-redesign-of-hiring/) - Download this free eBook to discover how hiring is being redesigned and how Agentic Al and Workforce Intelligence Will Reshape Work in 2026 and beyond.
- [Refondre le recrutement : comment l’orchestration, l’IA agentique et le pilotage intelligent des talents (“workforce planning”) redessinent le travail en 2026](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/fr/resources/ebooks/refondre-le-recrutement-comment-lorchestration-lia-agentique-et-le-pilotage-intelligent-des-talents-workforce-planning-redessinent-le-travail-en-2026/)
- [Rapport Taskforce DRH Connect exclusif : Faire du recrutement un levier stratégique](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/fr/resources/ebooks/faire-du-recrutement-un-levier-strategique/) - Notre rapport de préconisation exclusif de la Task Force DRH Connect rassemble des recommandations concrètes issues d’heures d’ateliers, d’échanges et de débats entre pairs.
- [A Seat at the Table: Guide to Leading a Strategic Talent Acquisition Function](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/a-seat-at-the-table-guide-to-leading-a-strategic-talent-acquisition-function/) - It’s hard to keep up with the constant change of the world of recruitment – high turnover, new talent expectations, explosion of hiring technologies – if you’re sitting in the back row. When talent acquisition lacks a seat at the table for high-level talent decisions, your organization misses out on the ability of TA to contribute to its success.
- [How to Get Started with AI in Recruitment](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/how-to-get-started-with-ai-in-recruitment/) - The rapid evolution of artificial intelligence (AI) is revolutionizing the recruitment landscape. Nearly 60% of TA leaders stated in a Josh Bersin Company survey said that increasing team efficiency and reducing costs will be a top priority for the coming year, and companies are looking to AI tools to fill the gap.
- [Guide to Evaluating the Business Value of a Talent Acquisition Platform](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/guide-to-evaluating-the-business-value-of-a-talent-acquisition-platform/) - Global economic uncertainty has led companies to consider cost-cutting measures even as they struggle to attract and retain talent. In this environment, TA leaders need to keep evolving their hiring practices while being asked to do more with less.
- [Global Hiring Trends 2023](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/global-hiring-trends-2023/) - In an age of evolving worker expectations, unpredictable economic conditions, and questions around the ever-changing future of work, talent leaders must keep their sights on attracting and hiring the people who will build and shape the future of their organizations.
- [Gen Z: Changing the Rules of Campus Recruiting](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/gen-z-changing-the-rules-of-campus-recruiting/) - Attracting Gen Z candidates is challenging. Luckily, we’ve got 10 tips to get campus recruiting right mapped out for you in this e-book.
- [Hiring Success Fundamentals](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/hiring-success-fundamentals/) - The eBook covers the fundamentals of Hiring Success: the ability to attract, select, and hire the best talent, on demand and on budget.
- [10 Signs Your ATS is Stuck in the 90’s](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/10-signs-your-ats-is-stuck-in-the-90s/) - Applicant tracking systems (ATS) were originally designed in the late 1990’s to automate the application for job seekers and to track applicants for employers. Unfortunately, the ATS hasn’t evolved enough over the past 15 years to meet the requirements for hiring success has left candidates, hiring leaders, recruiters and recruiting leaders feeling the pain.
- [How to Win in Talent Acquisition](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/how-to-win-in-talent-acquisition/) - We look ahead to a winning talent acquisition strategy in 2020 with resource and budget planning in mind. It can take months to gain internal alignment on the vision and strategy, gather requirements from all stakeholders, followed by research and evaluation (including assessment of vendors themselves) before making a decision. From there, it takes several more months to migrate data, deploy, train, and effectively roll out a new technology across any organization.
- [CRM: Proactive Hiring in a Candidate-driven Market](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/crm-proactive-hiring-in-a-candidate-driven-market/) - Reactive recruiting does not deliver results in today’s candidate-driven market, paving the way for a new breed of recruiting tactics. Candidate relationship management (CRM) solutions, which enable talent acquisition teams to nurture talent pools and market to passive candidates, are now vital for businesses to compete in the war for talent.
- [21 Tips and Tricks to Boost Your Employee Referral Program](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/21-tips-and-tricks-to-boost-your-employee-referral-program/) - Did you know...employee referrals are the #1 source of quality candidates for the most successful global organizations, resulting in faster hires, improved employee retention levels and higher profitability.
- [Avoiding the Pitfalls of ERP Systems in Talent Acquisition](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/avoiding-the-pitfalls-of-erp-systems-in-talent-acquisition/) - Research shows the people we hire make or break our companies. Yet, more than 70% of companies still struggle with recruiting. Complacent practices, a drastically-disrupted marketplace, and changing attitudes of job seekers are forcing companies to re-evaluate their recruiting practices and their recruiting technology in order to survive today’s volatile business climate. Consequently, organizations are abandoning their ERP systems’ recruiting modules at a rapid pace in favor of standalone, talent acquisition suites with deep recruiting capability.
- [ANZ Hiring Trends: What You Need To Know](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/anz-hiring-trends-what-you-need-to-know/) - Recruitment leaders in Australia and New Zealand face a labour shortage. While it’s harder to recruit than ever before, economic conditions mean that many are being asked to do more with less. To address these challenges, they’ve turned their attention to improving the candidate experience and transforming their technology to put the user at the centre.
- [A Practical Guide to Hiring for Skills](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/a-practical-guide-to-hiring-for-skills/) - The skills shortage is one of today's most pressing business concerns: 59% of CEOs expect the labor/skills shortage to influence or disrupt their business strategy. Traditional talent acquisition processes must evolve to adapt. The SmartRecruiters team of recruitment experts is here to help with a new ebook: A Practical Guide to Hiring For Skills.
- [Is Your Recruiting Data GDPR Compliant?](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/is-your-recruiting-data-gdpr-compliant/) - We live in unprecedented times. The rapid pace and spread of digital technologies has fundamentally and globally transformed the way we connect, the way we learn, the way we do business, and, incredibly personal to our mission, the way we engage and hire talent.
- [Building a Business Case for Recruitment CRM](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/building-a-business-case-for-recruitment-crm/) - A Candidate Relationship Management (CRM) system is a critical component of the modern talent acquisition technology stack. Companies recognize that they need a solution to be able to engage and nurture passive talent before the job application process begins.
- [Why SmartRecruiters for ATS Migration](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/why-smartrecruiters-for-ats-migration/) - A successful ATS migration needs the right technology, a committed team, an adaptable and collaborative implementation process, along with best-in-class knowledge transfer and training. SmartRecruiters has migrated thousands of companies around the world from legacy ATS systems like Taleo & BrassRing with a 100% success rate, many within 6 months.
- [UK Hiring Trends: What You Need To Know](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/uk-hiring-trends-what-you-need-to-know/) - Recruitment leaders in the United Kingdom face an uncertain market: a talent shortage, a recession, and runaway inflation. In an environment where many are being asked to do more with less, the savviest UK leaders have turned their attention to optimising the technology that powers their core hiring processes. At the same time, they’re upping their candidate attraction game through employer branding and recruitment marketing.
- [The Ultimate Applicant Tracking System Buyer’s Guide](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/the-ultimate-applicant-tracking-system-buyers-guide/) - Upgrading your recruitment platform can truly supercharge hiring, but buying and implementing an ATS is a big undertaking. The Ultimate Applicant Tracking System Buyer’s Guide: How to Evaluate Vendors and Win Stakeholder Support has you covered for every step of the ATS buying journey.
- [Guide to the European Union AI Act and Its Impact on Talent Acquisition](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/ebooks/guide-to-the-european-union-ai-act-and-its-impact-on-talent-acquisition/) - With AI's transformative potential capturing the attention of every industry, the European Parliament introduced the AI Act to regulate its development and use within the European Union (EU). As the first comprehensive framework of its kind, this legislation is poised to serve as a model for other regions around the world.

## Infographics

- [The Unexpected Returns of GDPR: Engaged Candidates](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/the-unexpected-returns-of-gdpr-engaged-candidates/) - Even with tight talent acquisition department budgets, you’re still tasked with enhancing your hiring process. This list of ways to improve the way you hire will help.
- [The Bay Area’s Workforce in 2020](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/the-bay-areas-workforce-in-2020/) - Business want great talent and candidates want great jobs. Take a look at this infographic to learn what the Bay Area workforce will look like in 5 years.
- [Abandoned Technology: Why TA Leaders have stopped using traditional recruiting software](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/abandoned-technology-why-ta-leaders-have-stopped-using-traditional-recruiting-software/) - Research conducted at the recent HR Technology conference provides insight into how traditional software is failing today’s Talent Acquisition leaders.
- [How to build a Cost-Saving Business Case for TA Transformation](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/how-to-build-a-cost-saving-business-case-for-ta-transformation/) - This infographic helps you pinpoint where to find cost savings and productivity improvements to get your CEO and CFO bought into your transformation project
- [7 Steps to a Talent Acquisition Reporting Strategy](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/7-steps-to-a-talent-acquisition-reporting-strategy/) - A solid reporting strategy helps TA teams make better decisions so that they can attract, select, and hire the best talent on time and within budget. Download the document to learn how to do it right in these seven easy steps.
- [5 Strategies for Meeting the Challenges of Retail Recruitment](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/5-strategies-for-meeting-the-challenges-of-retail-recruitment/) - Staffing retail stores presents unique challenges for hiring and retaining talent. Download the document to discover the keys to candidate satisfaction and employee retention in seasonal, high-volume hiring.
- [5 Recruitment Secrets of Professional Services Firms](https://www.smartrecruiters.com/resources/infographics/5-recruitment-secrets-of-professional-services-firms/) - Effective recruiting in professional services entails a multi-pronged approach that can be facilitated by the right technology. Download the document to discover five ways successful professional services firms are recruiting today.

